# The Spider-Lair: Evolved

> Definitive Public Release Changelog

The Spider-Lair: Evolved is the largest and final overhaul the world has received. It brings traversal, combat, multiplayer competition, progression, customization, filming, and community contributions together in one connected experience.

## Highlights

- Completely rebuilt web swinging, zipping, climbing, wallrunning, and movement.
- Full open-world combat with stealth, gadgets, enemy factions, drones, and environmental interactions.
- More than 60 hand-built combat zones with escalating difficulty and major boss encounters.
- Opt-in PvP, Zombies Mode, Threat Level progression, and Spider-Coin rewards.
- New Headquarters, Apartment, Lair Shop, Cinema tools, and patron personalization features.

