## Climbing, Wallrunning, and Surface Movement

- Omnidirectional climbing has been added.
- Players can rotate, pivot, and roll themselves with the thumbsticks while climbing.
- A hand can be prepared before touching a wall, causing the player to immediately stick on contact.
- Players can walk on ceilings.
- Wallrunning can automatically snap the player onto nearby surfaces.
- Players can walk around corners and transition between connected walls.
- Pressing Jump while climbing transitions directly into wallrunning.

