## Web Bridges

- Players can create up to ten Web Bridges.
- Web Bridges are local to each player rather than synchronized globally.
- Players can zip directly to Web Bridges.
- Bridges briefly snap the player into position without permanently locking them in place.
- Bridges use perch-style targeting for more accurate zipping.
- Holding both wrists together for three seconds clears all active Web Bridges and portals.

