## Web Interaction and Physics

- Enemies can be tied to walls and other surfaces.
- Enemies can be tied to one another.
- Enemies can be tethered to moving objects.
- Objects such as drones, grenades, rockets, and environmental props can be webbed together.
- Wrapped enemies visually inherit the player’s selected web appearance.
- Players can strike enemies while holding them.
- Web grabbing focuses on retracting the tether for more deliberate web-climbing behavior.

