## Portals

- Portals have been integrated into the Gadget Wheel and web-shooter system.
- Portals use both hands for placement.
- Players can lock onto portals with their crosshairs.
- Players can zip directly into and through portals.
- Dedicated portal perch points support more accurate traversal.
- Enemies and ragdolls can travel through portals.
- Enemies can be thrown directly into portals.
- Portal visuals respond to the selected quality preset.
- Portals and Web Bridges can be cleared together by holding both wrists together.

