## Slow Motion and Cloaking

- Slow motion has been added as a local player ability.
- Slow motion affects traffic, player physics, enemy ragdolls, world objects, particles, and audio.
- Dedicated screen and sound effects indicate when slow motion is active.
- The slow-motion visual effect can be independently disabled.
- Cloaking has been added as an alternate ability.
- Cloaking reduces enemy visibility and hides the player’s PvP indicator.
- Footstep noise can still reveal a cloaked player.
- Being detected while acting under cloak immediately disables the ability and drains its stored energy.

