## Drones

- Drone Operators deploy drones as a second set of eyes.
- Operators continue deploying replacement drones until incapacitated.
- Drone Operators will flee from the player.
- Drones scan the environment when neither the drone nor its operator has detected the player.
- Drones can be destroyed with webbing, projectiles, thrown objects, or melee attacks.
- Drones can be picked up and thrown.
- Drones fall inactive when their operator is defeated.

### Drone Types

- **Laser Drone:** Fires a laser at the player to inflict burn damage.
- **Razer Drone:** Charges the player with a blade before retreating and preparing another attack.
- **Taser Drone:** Fires electrical projectiles that drain 25% of player stamina and 25% of gadget ammunition.
- **Blazer Drone:** Uses a close-range flamethrower and can overload and explode when attacked.

