## Throwable Objects and Environmental Combat

- Throwable objects spawn near enemy encounters.
- Available objects include boxes, explosive barrels, fire hydrants, electrical boxes, manhole covers, and newsstands.
- Players can tether objects and aim throws with their free hand.
- Releasing the tether launches the object toward the opposite hand’s crosshair.
- The same aiming system applies to enemies, drones, grenades, and rockets.
- A ballistic trajectory indicator previews object throws.
- Environmental items can be connected to enemies or other moving objects with webs.

