## Combat Sectors and Open-World Gameplay Loop

- Enemies appear in hand-built combat sectors rather than purely random locations.
- More than 60 enemy spawning zones have been placed throughout the city.
- Bubble barriers prevent webs and projectiles from passing through them, while players can walk through.
- Each combat sector contains a central shield generator.
- The sector must be cleared of regular enemies and its Sniper Tower.
- Being spotted starts a 60-second reinforcement countdown.
- Failing to clear the sector in time calls a random boss for backup.
- After the enemies and boss are defeated, the shield tower must be web-yanked down.
- Destroying the tower lowers the sector shield and allows another combat zone to appear elsewhere in the city.

