## Zombies Mode

- Zombies Mode has been added as a complete alternate combat mode.
- Zombies use their own movement and pursuit behavior.
- Zombies can carry kamikaze grenades.
- Zombies use grapple hooks while falling or jumping.
- Zombies can teleport.
- The mode includes dedicated sound effects, voice lines, textures, and holographic visuals.
- A Razer Drone swarm serves as a Zombies Mode boss encounter.
- Zombies Mode can be activated through the Corrupted Code shop item.

