## PvP

- Player-versus-player combat has been added.
- PvP uses an opt-in toggle, allowing players to remain outside the system.
- Players can web onto other participating players.
- PvP participants use player markers similar to enemy indicators.
- Slow motion remains available during PvP.
- Cloaking hides the player’s PvP indicator.
- Lair Shop gameplay modifiers are disabled while PvP is active.
- A dedicated PvP killfeed has been added.
- Current player defeats are recorded in the statistics menu.
- The scoreboard prioritizes player defeats while the local player is participating in PvP.
- Being defeated in PvP relocates the player to a random location instead of performing a standard respawn.
- Teleporting directly to other players is disabled during PvP.

