## The Lair Shop and Spider-Coins

- The Lair Shop has been added as an in-world store.
- Players can purchase gameplay-altering items with Spider-Coins.
- Purchased items are stored in a persistent inventory.
- More than 45 items are available.
- The Spider-Coin carrying limit has been increased from 25 to 50.
- Patreon supporters receive two Spider-Coins for every one they collect.

