## Evolved Menu and Interface

- The entire menu has been redesigned with new animations and sound effects.
- The head button is the primary method of opening the menu.
- The menu opens in front of the player and remains in place, allowing the player to move around it.
- Menu height and distance automatically adjust to avatar size.
- The menu follows player height and aligns itself in 90-degree increments as the player turns.
- World settings such as weather, season, and time are grouped into a dedicated World menu.
- Voice controls have been simplified into a Global Voice option.
- A dedicated Gadget menu and loadout selector have been added.
- The statistics menu displays current enemy defeats and current player defeats.
- Scoreboard sorting changes based on the player’s activity:
  - PvP prioritizes player defeats.
  - Combat prioritizes current-run enemy defeats.
  - General play prioritizes overall rank.
- A death screen displays the player’s current score.
- Three quality presets provide simplified performance configuration.

