## Camera and Cinema Tools

- Auto-Cam has been added as a Patreon-exclusive intelligent spectator and recording system.
- Auto-Cam evaluates nearby enemies, thrown objects, collision, and active gameplay to select useful camera angles.
- More than two dozen camera styles can be selected manually.
- Auto-Cam hides gameplay icons from the recorded camera view.
- Auto-Cam is available on PC and is not supported by Quest VRChat cameras.
- Follow Player allows a user to attach their movement reference to another player while still moving around them for filming.
- The Sandbox menu has been expanded and renamed the Cinema menu.
- NPC No-Detect options can make bosses and Sniper Towers passive while hiding combat indicators.
- Immortality allows players to capture cinematic shots during combat, but it cannot be used for achievements, XP, or PvP.
- A video-player blackout mode has been added for a cleaner viewing environment.

