## Patron World Personalization

- **$5+ patrons** can submit custom graffiti artwork to be permanently displayed throughout the skate park.
- **$10+ patrons** can submit custom comic books to be permanently added to Spider-Lair: Evolved.
- **Active $20 patrons** can create a personalized version of The Apartment with custom walls, floors, colors, artwork, decorations, and themes.
- Custom apartment designs automatically load when their owner enters, allowing everyone inside to see the personalized space.
- If multiple eligible patrons are inside, the apartment cycles between designs based on who entered first.
- These additions allow patrons to leave a personal and lasting mark throughout the world.
